<title>CHILE: Chilgener Q1 net income soars.</title>
<headline>Chilgener Q1 net income soars.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's second largest power generator Chilgener reported net earnings of 33.95 billion pesos in the first quarter, up 187 percent on the same period last year.</p>
<p>The firm's operating income climbed 96 percent to 25.44 billion pesos.</p>
<p>Chilgener reported a non-operating profit of 13.22 billion pesos compared with a 663 million peso loss in the first three months of last year.</p>
<p>Revenues increased to 65.86 billion pesos from 34.47 billion pesos in the first quarter 1996.</p>
</text>
